PU290119-1244234	29/01/2019	Partial relief Granted	Dear sir i have tried several time for my domestic meter in sui gas office for the correction of pressure factor which in the bill is increased for my house. I have tried to rectify it several times but there is not positive response. I have attached my bill please see the gas consumed and after press factor bill charged. I am overally charged as compared to normal billing. Please correctbthe bill which i am paying from last 2 3 years that is charged extra.	"Respected  Citizen! with reference to your complaint regarding adjustment of Pressure Factor, our team visited your premises and noted site pressure 0.75 Psi. The site pressure has been incorporated in the system and you are being billed at pressure 0.75 Psi with effect from 06-02-2019 as per company policy and the same pressure has been reflected accordingly in your gas bill. If you still need any further clarification, please call us at 041-9210044. Any inconvenience faced in this regard is apologized .We greatly value your esteemed relationship with the company. 
