It is submitted that we have thoroughly examined your complaint and wish to inform you that,Subject property has been sold and divided into 4 separate portions and according to site visit report of our field staff Service line does not exist in front of the portion that you have purchased. You are therefore advised to visit our Customer Service Center with following documents from Monday to Friday during office hours and apply afresh for new Gas connection for your portion/House;

