connected load. Complete house line of the consumer was scanned and it was observed that it was open and connected to the appliances. Further  boundaries of the premises were scanned  and no anomaly or theft of gas was observed. However, we are grateful that you have sent us the complaint regarding theft of gas and request you to provide any such evidence which you understand that could not be covered by us. We will always welcome your complaints that can help us to identify any theft of gas. Meanwhile, we assure our best of services.
