PU300420-7830616	30/04/2020	Partial relief Granted	"Subject: False Complaint by Meter Reader :: The user is the strict law abiding citizen of Pakistan. Due to Precarious and corrupt reasons being habitual, your Meter reader has filed complaint against the user. The Checking team has checked it twice, opened the meter and re-fixed leading to gas leakage both the times and they told us that the complaint lodged is false and the meter reader seems corrupt. The checkers also donot obtain any permission for checking which is unethical.  Whole of the street has their own meters and there is not a single commercial activity as well.  Such a Poor and Corrupt way to harm the domestic users is highly objectionable and may pose serious outcomes in future, if this is not stopped. Now the gas smell still prevails around meter after reopening. If the department fails to act against meter reader, it will be tried at higher levels. Please take necessary action."	"Dear Citizen,
We wish to inform that our team visited your premises on report of meter reader regarding extension of pipe and there was no extension found. However, our team revisited your premises after few days to make sure that there was no misuse of gas, according to our team there was no violation found. No leakage was identified during the visit of your house. Anyhow, we will dispatch a team to visit your premises again and rectify if any anomaly is found. We apologize for the any inconvenience faced by our valued consumer. 
We will continue to serve you to the best of our abilities.
