PU230221-88029681	23/02/2021	Relief Granted	"Subject: SNGPL Gas Meter Rule Violations :: Complaint Subject: SNGPL Gas Meter Rule Violations   With due respect, i want to inculcate the severe discipline and policy violation of SNGL. Where my neighbours had hired local plumber to put-off the gas meter from our premises and installed it on their wall without our consent and without informing your prestigious company. Hence, now my gas connection supply is discontinued and we are facing too much problem in this winter when gas is needed at most desire. Moreover, i want to emphasize that we have informed SNGPL by written application no (6950) Dated: 1st Feb,2021 but there has been no action taken from SNGPL  company so far far. We do not want to violate the law and want justice under the horizon of law. Therefore, it is requested please resolve the issue as soon as possible and install the gas meter where it was originally installed.  Sui Gas Meter Owner: Muhammad Rafiq s/o Abdul Aziz House no: (P-13) 406/76  Muhallah: Street #1, Muhallah Danish pura, Tehsil Samundari, District: Faisalabad Contact : 03017161514"	"Dear Citizen,
