We wish to inform that our raiding party conducted raid on the canteen/hotel situated adjacent to Faisalabad Press Club on 15.06.2021. Thorough inspection of the hotel was carried out and it revealed that gas was being stolen directly from a fake service line found inside the hotel. Fake service line was removed and booking of violation charges along with legal action against the culprits is underway. We appreciate the concern and cooperation of our valued citizen to intimate us regarding any suspicion of violation/theft w.r.t gas in their surroundings. We will continue to serve you to the best of our abilities.
