This is with reference to the complaint lodged regarding disconnection of your meter by SNGPL without any reason. In this context, we wish to apprise that your meter was found installed at an empty plot where no domestic residence was observed and illegal extension of gas was given through rubber pipes to many quarters, which can lead to severe consequences i-e fire incident due to leakage, theft of gas etc, and it is also violation of contract you have signed with SNGPL. Therefore, your meter bearing consumer #94437310009 was disconnected on 18.05.2021(site report and pictures attached). You are advised to visit Faisalabad regional office with required documents to get your re-connection processed.
We will continue to serve you to the best of our abilities.
