FC260521-88417726	26/05/2021	Relief cannot be Granted	"Subject: Gas Meter Removed without Information :: Complaint Subject: Gas Meter Removed without Information   Hi Sir,i am overseas Pakistani from last 11 years, in my home my parents aged more than 75 years and wife is living,recently on 19th of this month some named Azam(might be a employee or contractor of sui gas)removed the meter with out letting us know,2 days my father tried to search who removed it without success and after 2 days he called him and informed that meter was removed by us due to meter reversal,just to explain this complaint,they came to our house a month ago,told my father there is leakage in meter we are removing it and fixing the problem,after that they removed it and fixed the meter again.now they removed the meter permanently with out informing anyone at my home. And are saying by calling my father that the meter was reversed.i just want to tell U that this meter is installed at our house since 90's. Why would we steal gas now?why would we reverse the meter now?there are only 3 person at my home,elderly parents and wife,how much gas they can consume?plz take action"	"Dear Citizen,
This is with reference to the complaint lodged regarding disconnection of your meter by SNGPL without any reason. In this context, we wish to apprise that your meter was reported reversed by the meter reader of billing section, which is a serious violation of the gas sales agreement you have signed with SNGPL. Therefore, your meter bearing consumer #78552310001 was disconnected on 20.05.2021 on account of violation (site report and pictures attached). You are advised to visit Faisalabad regional office with required documents to get your re-connection processed after paying your bill of violation charges.
We will continue to serve you to the best of our abilities.
