PU241221-89483124	24/12/2021	Relief Granted	"Complaint Subject: Excessive electric compressor usage by gas customers   Sir I belong to ward no 5,Jhang city  There is massive gas pressure reduction in gas supply in these winter days. I understand this reduction due to increase in demand. But every 2nd or 3rd home in our area have electric compressor in their homes so they attract this remaining reduced supply towards their homes and we have zero pressure of gas in times when even there is supply available because of them. In case of Electricity loadshedding,when they  are unable to operate these compressors,there is huge increase in our gas supply pressure. My demand is please take action agaisnst this injustice with us who don't want to go towards this illegal compressor option being a law abiding citizen. They can track these people by their meter readings when their is gas shortage in area but their meter are working with high speeds,that's just my simple humble opinion. Rest of responsibility is on respective authority to solve this as soon as possible."	"Dear Citizen,
We wish to inform that our vigilance team visited locality of Ward #5 at Jhang City on 03.01.2022. Thorough inspection of the vicinity was carried out and 03 Nos. domestic meters were disconnected on account of compressor use (site visit reports attached).   
We appreciate the concern and cooperation of our valued citizen to intimate us regarding any suspicion of violation / theft w.r.t gas in their surroundings. We will continue to serve you to the best of our abilities.
