PU200122-89606835	20/01/2022	Relief Granted	"Complaint Subject: Usage of Electric Devices (Compressor)   Dear sir, I feel sorry to inform that majority of  domestic users use electric devices (compressor) to increase their gas pressure. Whenever electricity is turned off, we have the normal pressure to cook. If nobody use the device, every one could have gas available. But now a days, we are having gas maximum of 1 hour out of 24 hours. Complaint was registered earlier and the staff visited but one visit is not enough. If your staff will be active, it will create deterrence. It is requested to direct your staff to have frequent visits specially during cooking hours and take all compressors. In custody. This will really help me to reduce my domestic expenses in terms of LPG. One more thing, we are facing low pressure in this winter season in Jhang City area as compared to last 3 years. It would be highly appreciated if some action is taken against this."	"Dear Citizen,
