PU180424-91239992	18/04/2024	Relief cannot be Granted	"Complaint Subject: Illegal Connection of Gas meter   It has come to my attention that Mr. Mehmboob Alam, residing at Ch 371 J/B Ganda Singh Gojra, has been sharing a gas meter with his son (Anser Tatla) and daughter in an unauthorized and unsafe manner. This arrangement not only violates the regulations set forth by your esteemed company but also puts the lives and property of the residents at risk. Sharing a gas meter in such an awkward and illegal manner can lead to gas leaks, explosions, and other hazardous incidents that could result in loss of life and property damage. As concerned members of the community, we cannot afford to overlook such dangerous practices that jeopardize the safety of our neighborhood. Therefore, I kindly urge you to take immediate action to investigate and rectify this illegal gas connection. It is imperative that the necessary measures are taken to disconnect the unauthorized connection and ensure that Mr. Mehmboob Alam and his family comply with the legal requirements for obtaining a separate gas meter"	"RE: PU180424-91239992
