PU100524-91274092	10/05/2024	Relief cannot be Granted	"Complaint Subject: Illegal Connection of Gas Meter   RE:  PU180424-91239992 On the 8th of May, 2024, a vigilance team visited the locality of 371 JB Ganda Singh Gojra in District Toba Tek Singh. Upon inspection, it was observed that an illegal connection of the gas pipe was in place. Subsequently, the team took immediate action, and the illegal connection was removed, as evidenced by pictorial documentation. However, upon the team's departure, Mr. Mahboob Aalam, in a regrettable display of defiance, not only verbally abused the team but also explicitly stated, ""Tusi jo marzi kar lu ma na pipe lagana ha"" (Do whatever you want, I have to install the pipe). Such disregard for safety regulations and disrespect towards the vigilance team is unacceptable. I urge authorities to take serious action against Mr. Mahboob Aalam, including imposing penalties such as the uninstallation of the gas meter, to deter such behavior in the future and ensure the safety of the community. For detail Pls contact Rizwan Rasheed Mobile 03337172371"	"RE: PU180424-91274092
