PU130524-91277285	13/05/2024	Relief Granted	"Complaint Subject: Theft of Gas   It's concerning to hear about the serious allegations against Nazim Mudrasa Qari Shahid, especially as someone newly appointed by Jamia Muhammadi Sharif Bhowana. Theft of gas and electricity not only violates the law but also poses safety risks and infringes upon the rights of others. Taking swift action to address these issues is essential to ensure fair and legal distribution of utilities.  Reporting this matter to the relevant authorities or utility providers is the first step towards resolving the situation. Strict legal action should indeed be taken against those found responsible for such actions, including Nazim e Mudrasa Qari Shahid. Installing separate commercial meters for each shop inside the mosque and thoroughly investigating the theft allegations are necessary steps to prevent further misuse and maintain the integrity of utility services.  Given the gravity of the situation, issuing an FIR (First Information Report) and imposing fines on Qari Shahid as per legal provision"	"RE: PU130524-91277285
