PU041224-91630420	04/12/2024	Relief Granted	Complaint Subject: Gas Low Pressure   Guzarish hai k mohallah mustafabad Lalian Distt. Chiniot mei gas k jo makhsus auqat hain jin mei khana wagera pakana hota hai un mei gas ya to time py ati nhi ya phir na hony k brabar hoti hai jic ki waja se masla bnta hai kafi. Lalian city mei mostly logon ne compressor wagera lagae howy hain gharon mei jic ki waja se yeh masla hai. Mehbani kr k ya to ap apny end py search kr k un logon k compressor bnd karwain ya phir hamain bhi parmission dain ta k hum bhi compressor laga k apna kitchen chala sakin. Jb gas bhi ata hai to start mei 5 se 7 mint tk burner khol k rakhna parta hai kun k tb gas ki bjae air nikalti hai aur kafi dair k bd ahista ahista gas ana shoro hota hai woh bhi low pressure mei.jo hamain btaya gia hai ya lagta hai k aksar gharon mei compressor ka istemal ho raha hai jic ki waja se yeh masla hai. Mehbani kr k ap ic k khilaf janch partal kr k sakht action lain ta k jo ake aam ghareeb admi hai oc tk wasaile asani se muyasar aa sakin. Allah Pak ap ko khush rakhy. Shukria	"RE: PU041224-91630420
