PU250325-91822520	25/03/2025	Relief Granted	"Complaint Subject: Sui Gas Pump Usage in the Area   Assalam o Alaikum!   My name is Ukasha and I live in Ghulam Muhammad Abad Faisalabad. For the past few days, I've noticed that the gas pressure is relatively low around 12 pm to 12:45 pm. After that, the pressure suddenly increases. At first, I was confused but now I'm sure that someone is using an illegal gas pump because of that the other law-abiding citizens are suffering. I'm sure you know that according to the schedule, the gas is provided from 12 pm till 1 pm.    The SNGPL has done a wonderful job maintaining a schedule but because of some corrupted people, we are not able to do our chores efficiently.   I humbly request the authority to take action against this illicit activity.   Thank you  - Ukasha"	"RE: PU250325-91822520
