Dear Citizen,	
     We wish to inform that on your complaint regarding illegal shifting of gas connection. Thorough inspection of the case was carried and found that meter was installed at P-803 (P-706) St. No. 09, Muhammad Abad, Faisalabad against the owner of Property Muhammad Boota. However, after the sale of property meter was re-named against the new owner Muhammad Akbar and is present at his side of property. Meter was in use of both owners of property without any conflict until the change of ownership to the current owner of property. Hence, there is no Violation / Illegal shifting of meter. Meter is at current owner?s premises as per SOPs.
We appreciate the concern and cooperation of our valued citizen to intimate us regarding any suspicion of violation / theft w.r.t gas in their surroundings. We will continue to serve you to the best of our abilities.
