PU300726-92721989	30/07/2026	Relief Granted	"Complaint Subject: Request for Investigation into Suspected Unauthorized Gas Use   I am a resident of Chak No. 285 JB and respectfully request an investigation into suspected unauthorized use of natural gas in our locality. The concern relates to a gas connection associated with Nasar, son of Hassan Muhammad, a resident of Chak No. 285 JB. Based on observations and information available in the neighborhood, I suspect that natural gas from this connection may be supplied to other nearby houses through unauthorized means. I am not in a position to confirm this, and therefore I request SNGPL to conduct a fair and impartial technical inspection of the gas meter, service line, and any associated connections. If the investigation finds any unauthorized gas distribution or other violations of SNGPL rules, I request that appropriate action be taken in accordance with the applicable laws and regulations. If no violation is found, I will respect the outcome of the investigation. I also request that my identity be kept confidential throughout the process I ll be thankful"	"RE: PU300726-92721989
